    "created_at": "2018-09-07T03:19:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-09-07T03:19:54Z",
    "body": "I have no idea about other ways to set about:srcdoc to an existing document.\r\n\r\n\"URL and history update steps\" is used by [```pushState()```](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/history.html#dom-history-pushstate), but I think about:src is rejected by security checks in Step 7 of ```pushState()``` and ```replaceState()```\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
